+ item Item?
+ index Size = 0
+ is-highlighted = #palette?.#selected-index == #index

• This • flex-row
    focus-mode = FocusMode.press

────────────────────
for event on click

. owner = palette
. picked = item
if owner && picked
    owner.choose(picked)
event.cancel()

